Diagnostics only (MY355_DIAG=1): where `mmc dev 1` spends its time.

A bootstage mark at each step of SD card init and around the partition scan
that probing the block device runs, the number of ACMD41 polls the card
needed, and the duration of every block read, printed to the console record.

`mmc dev 1` takes 202 ms here against ~77 ms for the kernel on the same card
(docs/uboot.md).

